      <description><![CDATA[<p>haus 0.31.3 with manifest v0.118</p><p>manifest v0.118: good-take circles and hearts beside the thumbnail; Report per camera in the Wrap (one PDF per camera); Phantom .cine clips get their metadata; clips with the same name (a prelight card) each get their own row; only a good take prints its circle; safety fixes. haus 0.31.3: the tool switcher never prints into a PDF.</p>]]></description>
